f printed SPO pages, a printed licensing checklist sheet, a printed A4 intradialytic observation sheet (text not readable), and a laptop showing the package's Excel tools (a shift staffing sheet with green and red status cells, and a dashboard with a line chart). Preserve exact product proportions, packaging appearance and visible design details. Do not redesign, simplify, recolor, or rebrand the product. SET & PROPS: Hemodialysis unit staff records room in the late afternoon: grey metal filing cabinets, a small table, a shelf of individual staff files in plain colored folders (no readable text), warm side light from a high window; then the small HD unit office with a desk and a laptop. No other people. TIMELINE — 10 seconds: 0–2s Hook · close-up: his hand lowers a phone; cut to medium shot by the filing cabinets as he looks to the camera. VO (ID, verbatim): "Kabid minta data sertifikat dialisis." Delivery (EN): calm, serious 2–4s Problem · medium shot, he pulls one plain folder from the shelf of staff files. VO (ID, verbatim): "Datanya di map masing-masing perawat." Delivery (EN): honest 4–6s Problem · medium close-up, he flips the folder open, frowning slightly. VO (ID, verbatim): "Ada yang mungkin hampir habis." Delivery (EN): concerned 6–8s Problem · medium shot, he closes the folder and looks at the camera. VO (ID, verbatim): "Saya belum tahu siapa saja." Delivery (EN): honest, a little uneasy 8–10s Beat · medium shot, he walks out toward the unit office with the folder. VO: none. AUDIO: Quiet office ambience, a cabinet drawer closing, distant hospital corridor sounds. Only the talent speaks. Natural Indonesian, conversational, clear pronunciation, no background music. Lighting/mood: realistic natural light matching the set, clean soft contrast, believable Indonesian setting, not glossy, not studio. Camera: follow the camera style above consistently; stable and restrained, no whip pans, no drone, no 360 orbit. Keep product readable whenever it is on screen. Performance: natural facial expression, believable professional UGC, natural eye contact, restrained gestures, no exaggerated acting. Lips clearly synced to each word. Hands: simple, natural, relaxed movements. CLEAN OUTPUT: No subtitles, captions, generated text overlays, watermark, poster layout, storyboard panels, or added graphics. Do not invent product details, claims, prices, ratings, testimonials, certifications, or guarantees. Keep exact talent face, the WARDROBE above, product shape, colors, packaging, box, navy folder, printed sheets, laptop screen, laptop screen content, and visual details consistent with the DNA references.